{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_title", "source_sha256": "5a2de97e9db3e89c54762d0ec66e0b4859c503c4fce57e520c06984d7e28033a", "ja": "さよなら、今は。", "zh": "再见，暂时。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7bf63746f734ecbc4e20ce900857cb0054c9a45ae2c9a098c40ee1a80e067f6d", "ja": "定期公演の企画を任された律子だが、プロデ\nューサーが多忙なため、ロクに話し合う事も\nできない。そんな中新曲を受け取り、自分の\n気持ちを見つめ直した律子は、つたない言葉\nながらも今の感情を精いっぱい伝える。", "zh": "被委以定期公演企划重任的律子，却因制作\n人过于忙碌，连好好商谈都做不到。\n在此期间收到新曲的律子重新审视了内心的\n想法，即便言辞笨拙，也竭尽全力传达出了\n自己当下的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1000_p", "source_sha256": "028767552bf28a84eac2f2995831c2371312f6654b9cadf1794db879c0608d8d", "ja": "（地方公演の打ち合わせに、みんなの\nレギュラー仕事の調整。目まぐるしい日が続いている）", "zh": "（要商量地方公演的安排，还要协调大家的常规工作。这样忙得不可开交的日子还在持续着。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1001_p", "source_sha256": "650aeb6e2f0a9a1527fdd765e09e29b8423f85b72e8f340bb70da70b15b285ce", "ja": "（そんな中、定期公演で初披露予定の、\n律子の新曲が届いた。急いで届けないとな）", "zh": "（与此同时，律子预定在定期公演上首次披露的新歌送到了。得赶紧送过去才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1002_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bc0482b872f76bdac7af957685ca1bfd26f8b02bf37442852a64759b5947183c", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様……ゲホッ、ゴホッ！\nす、すまない。走ったら、咳が……ゲホッ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了……咳、咳咳！\n抱、抱歉。跑得太急，咳得停不……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "275be0be494a1f16ddf3266393a7408fce72e621a6393b38aad2eeaadf5cdee3", "ja": "{$P$}？\nどうしたんですか、そんなに急いで……。", "zh": "{$P$}？怎么了，干吗这么急……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a5988a9f42e6e044682d19b1b053584d7f2855c38b4506f5568e333414cd5f13", "ja": "いや、律子の新曲が届いたから持ってきたんだ……。\n聞いてもらおうと思って……ゲホッ、ゲホッ。", "zh": "没有，因为律子的新歌送过来了，我就给拿过来了……\n想让你听听……咳、咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "da8e83a38e27c621a0d9506d61aa0dd74bd23e4d33fb5b6f22f573b4e4a26ed2", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nだからって、そんなに慌てて走ってこなくても……。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n不过，也不用这么慌慌张张地跑过来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e527baac8c963f990497109a2c9c5eef67980a53c6c2d96ec81f572f2dbf20f5", "ja": "うん。でも直接、律子の意見が聞きたかったんだ。\nこれは次の公演で、律子に歌ってもらう新曲だしな。", "zh": "嗯。不过我想当面听听律子的意见。\n毕竟这是下一场演出里，要让律子唱的新歌啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "8f225c1c3bd7b977bd4905b6a5fe6cdd0d3ef09908f5b27a7db25fa2753202bf", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\n……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1009_p", "source_sha256": "156841675ab9ad20ae792acf83f092e7c7b91e98aaa23c7330286cd915b827f3", "ja": "ああ。早速だけど、聞いてくれ！", "zh": "啊。虽然突然了点，但听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "b932b52b9d54a98d707f9b5d4c0e6a775b2708bef56832876e707a754ed2cd30", "ja": "あら……素敵なバラード。いいなー律子ちゃん。\n素敵な曲、もらったじゃない！", "zh": "哎呀……好动人的抒情歌。真羡慕你啊，律子。\n这不是拿到了一首很棒的歌嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "22be6abe17b972506f2f7038502da7dee9abb1dd95a2e097b8bf3beaf48662a5", "ja": "真、美しき楽曲です。\n律子の歌声にぴったりかと。", "zh": "真是美妙的乐曲。\n我觉得很适合律子的歌声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b4d2ff21acb1f6c48fe338dc1e2617e47d4a3680d2d3581b3df9c65e38cc46e1", "ja": "……律子？", "zh": "……律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "313f454474c56fd64e0efad0bd851cef43ff0b01bd512eb3b926b23f29243ab6", "ja": "あの……ラブソング、ですよね。これ。", "zh": "那个……这是情歌，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7e28f2db81678441714d175774e982b26c943f28b9dd1e2127279807be86eec1", "ja": "そうだな。\n……こういう曲、嫌いか？", "zh": "是啊。\n……你不喜欢这种歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "38b18a389f18a5af5056dc809561d1cac943ef4ca5217da721255e9cfdb12ea9", "ja": "別に、嫌いとかじゃないです。\nでも……ううん。", "zh": "倒也不是讨厌。\n不过……不，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "94ec08d87b2dba0d037b2a4397ca997897f76ee3fa653ea85abfe5bed016266a", "ja": "ただ、こういう……乙女の恋心みたいな曲は、\n前にもやってますよね？", "zh": "只是，这种……像少女恋心一样的歌曲，我们之前也唱过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3b38c43238928d76630a9520a5ded7076699c4e87145369499342c09e66d675e", "ja": "新鮮味がないって事か？　でも、\nバラードはあまりないと思うし……。", "zh": "是觉得没什么新鲜感吗？不过，我觉得抒情曲好像不太多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cf681262152a9abd38730ca6a710fb5392e62ebc395dfc04f04ce85d5ade4529", "ja": "こういう少し大人っぽい曲で、\nアプローチを変えてみようと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "我是想通过这种稍微成熟一点的歌曲，尝试改变一下路线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "399729a4d38f8ff71fcc012fde6cac4f03e842009fcbd07999d6498ad20d6803", "ja": "律子の曲って、けっこうカワイイのが多いよね！\n意外と乙女っぽいっていうか。", "zh": "律子的歌里，挺多都是可爱风格的呢！\n感觉意外地很有少女心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "4e13e20d4b23ec12af4a2fb5546c049a3abfccd1998ff03c9f2f0191ec0e1f73", "ja": "意外とは余計でしょ、響！　それに可愛い曲が\n多いのは、ラブソングのせいっていうか……。", "zh": "说什么“意外”呢，响！而且，可爱的歌曲比较多，也算是因为情歌的缘故吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "50b7bf0113743bf84dc9d87a8fc8d89b9d16227ad06448c945a054815dd49759", "ja": "律子さんは、可愛いものが好きなんですね～。\nふふふ。", "zh": "律子小姐很喜欢可爱的东西呢～。\n呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "d630f3636fbb87e75b671764941be5388a44a0dccc20dd48d7fab88904e1bb31", "ja": "な、何よ、美也まで……。\nもう……この際だから、ついでに聞きますけど！", "zh": "什、什么呀，连美也也……  \n真是的……既然这样，我顺便问一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "9ebe4af427c3a1cb2723df5ce9c25a64446b91af192abe28f594e51ab062b5a4", "ja": "{$P$}って、\n私のこと、どう思ってるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n到底是怎么想我的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1027_p", "source_sha256": "75bbbdf096949cecbfd7c9f0218665dba7aa7f3005cef1ba12712d885c9acf60", "ja": "え？　どうって……。", "zh": "诶？什么怎么想……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "8c0278a2a8b0e0c4f49156a60ed4d31c13090c60fedb22200b3a19c6caad2b28", "ja": "言葉のままです。いいから、聞かせてください。\nでないと、歌えません！", "zh": "就是字面意思。别废话了，说给我听。不然，我没办法唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1029_p", "source_sha256": "015097c45ef3ee2ff3d85429b39d7d1ec1d1bfd999e22c7b489b92a8f0840864", "ja": "いや、どうも何も……\n律子は、765プロの大切なアイドルだよ。", "zh": "不，哪有什么怎么看……\n律子是765事务所非常重要的偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1030_p", "source_sha256": "452c91e03028be9fbe9103f29ebb804cbde4df940d36288aabbd9db92eaafc66", "ja": "それから仕事の上でも、大切な仲間だ。\n今回に限らず、頼りにしてる。同僚っていうか……。", "zh": "而且在工作上，她也是重要的伙伴。不只是这次，我一直都很依赖她。该说是同事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1032_p", "source_sha256": "322a363030d20e3caf7b882f5c6d9a32417a5debbd18078546a56cfc6f5b92a9", "ja": "律子？", "zh": "律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec8979a1569395a5289f9be557d33fac06cada8b461cb92363c525b305f62840", "ja": "いえ。……ですよね！\nそう言われると思ってました。", "zh": "没。……也是呢！\n我就知道您会这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "4d0b26dfd2a99ffc4bb04ee2fd4c5ae404abf6f54d9fe78d515a3c0ec466c810", "ja": "新曲、しっかり歌えるようにがんばります。\n大丈夫です、まかせてください！", "zh": "我会努力把新歌唱好。\n没问题，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "1101abe362ea6154a88e39951d8f3c81f3ff7a797ebf2069fcf58c4d17743704", "ja": "さあ、練習練習！\nがんばりましょうね、みんな！", "zh": "来，练习练习！\n大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1038_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1039_p", "source_sha256": "186fcba150fde9f91e39c8227215849eb2624d488d087cbab520be30f729f147", "ja": "え？　レッスンに来てないって……律子が？", "zh": "咦？你说律子没来参加训练……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "c998195d5e86a285abf871ec37902452ff65322ee17f2c577a222cfab7b8479b", "ja": "はい～。みんなでやる曲のレッスンは\n進んでいるので、問題ないんですけど……。", "zh": "是的～。大家一起排练的歌曲进展得很顺利，所以没什么问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "4df9f197c6104b76970488ddce36e101f9bf457d9232d619812a95b3544476a3", "ja": "ソロ曲がまだなのよね。\n律子ちゃん、何か悩んでるみたいで……。", "zh": "个人曲还没开始呢。\n律子好像有什么烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "577c59f8f4529cd165fe705826aa1a294a495471bbb77a060b49358c8eb6adda", "ja": "参考にするって言ってたのに、この前買った本も、\nレッスンルームに置きっぱなしだぞ。", "zh": "明明说过要拿来参考的，前些天买的那本书也一直放在练习室里没拿走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1043_p", "source_sha256": "e3a4df9fedd2487759488a53a75b060d4b2bc01ad26be43347db3508869798ad", "ja": "どうして……いや、もしかして俺のせいか……？\n律子の希望と、違う曲だったから……。", "zh": "为什么……不，难道是我的错……？\n因为那首歌和律子的期望不一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "ad566c6bf115bd8e79ee532b515b4105c6e06fae9282e99dfa764278783e7bdf", "ja": "そうですね……確かに新曲を受け取った時、\n律子嬢は困惑していたように見えましたが……。", "zh": "是啊……新曲交到律子小姐手里时，她看起来确实有些困惑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "60dc45c4a947c852a55798ced0018cdfa804fea7aa151a415b7ff06051bbd919", "ja": "けど、それだけではないのでは。\n……何か他にも、理由がある気がします。", "zh": "不过，应该还不止这些。\n……我总觉得，似乎还有其他理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "2039166fa52b2844f6adbdb6c46d36dc3a592f7bf9f809a2cc6c7d671b567c5c", "ja": "んもう！　律子ちゃんがしっかりしてるからって、\n{$P$}くんが放っておくからよ！", "zh": "真是的！就因为律子很靠得住，\n{$P$}君才总是不管她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "64b7fb1541ef738400397c02effa38568c588804c65290b6429a47b932ec441d", "ja": "どんなにしっかりしてても、\n律子ちゃんはまだ19歳の女の子なのよ？", "zh": "不管多么能干，律子也还是只有19岁的女孩子呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "c565417fce4c3f0329a720f358e270372e6cfc7e40092030a6d0bf5a1494d583", "ja": "でも今回のライブは、律子が企画やりたいって\n言ったんでしょ？　自分でもそう言ってたし……。", "zh": "不过这次的演唱会，是律子说想负责策划的吧？她自己也这么说过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1049_013hib", "source_sha256": "eea71c580d858c7f70e02b86d0e13606f19c5aba2385ec232241114f206564ec", "ja": "あ、でも新曲のお披露目は、\nちょっと不安だって言ってたかも。", "zh": "啊，不过她好像说过，对新歌的首次披露有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1050_p", "source_sha256": "275770dfa1b8c731fd751b1768c354b988ebedb390b78a4453a175dc27716cff", "ja": "そうだったのか……。", "zh": "原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1051_042miy", "source_sha256": "d630261b558fe5a38a20b2552383aa2f70c80e07b4add79613ef9bd4bfc2a720", "ja": "私たちが、話を聞いてあげられればよかったん\nですけど……律子さん、どこにいるんでしょう～。", "zh": "要是我们能听她说说话就好了……律子小姐，她在哪里呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1052_008tak", "source_sha256": "36a52851026990bebff127ac9f52315be90fe03ad46ab7334be9424aa26ed4a7", "ja": "まだレッスン時間です。律子嬢は必ず\n近くにいるかと。……{$P$}。", "zh": "现在还是练习时间。律子姑娘一定\n就在附近。……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0301eb95fc02ef0a6ebaa9baed787634089822b98c36ff3d70b8ea8e580a0c99", "ja": "わかった。\nありがとう、みんな。律子を探してみる！", "zh": "我知道了。\n谢谢大家。我去找找律子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1054_p", "source_sha256": "890bc7a56adf9dc5d9a19c8a5804c322e17f7f0a3aa83748f2789e7a45142634", "ja": "（律子、そんなに悩んでいたのか……\n忙しさにかまけていたとはいえ、気付けなかった）", "zh": "（律子原来一直这么烦恼吗……\n虽然我总拿忙碌当借口，却没能察觉到。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1055_p", "source_sha256": "ee4a303ea90600600d67061d79646d68c7af6037652ef8ba7222cae2bcc3210c", "ja": "律子、探したぞ。ここにいたんだな。", "zh": "律子，我找了你好久。原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1057_p", "source_sha256": "59723fed47358483c4bddac1f60a0bf2256369c215b5f4fee4459cd694e8a596", "ja": "少し、話をしたいんだけど……その前に。\n任せきりな事を怒ってるなら、本当にごめん。", "zh": "想跟你谈谈……不过在那之前。\n如果是因为我都甩给你做而在生气的话，真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1058_p", "source_sha256": "a562f82ebf22cb048421ee74bc34c2a5261f16b88d996d7b1c0cc90361c7dae1", "ja": "だから、レッスンに来なかったのか？", "zh": "所以，你才没来上训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1059_009rit", "source_sha256": "3a52bccd0a0409a0c8a8bbbb665b2dd8080162f9fa30cc989be77da7aa8483e3", "ja": "別に、怒ってはいませんけど……\nそれって、理由を言わないとダメですか？", "zh": "我又没生气……\n难道非得说出理由不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1060_p", "source_sha256": "b4fd08f84b4562497a6c92457115dd1fd48d2cc5a75808bf8c76a5fa78b3a8f3", "ja": "口にしないと伝わらない事もあるだろ。\nもちろん、強制するつもりはないけど……。", "zh": "有些事不说出来，是无法传达的吧。\n当然，我也没打算强迫你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1061_009rit", "source_sha256": "f2b12a4fcde57cb2d81c3e7f5055238bfc316be27a6a57f8c580dfc261e83b20", "ja": "そうですね。\n……でも、下手に言葉にすると、間違えそうで。", "zh": "是啊。\n……可是，要是贸然说出来，感觉反而会说错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1062_p", "source_sha256": "546d757a273cd59ab4bcaa7a8a5851c2f35f51ebda293aa61126d97cd2adfbb4", "ja": "間違える、か。俺も、何か間違えたのかな。\n新曲とか……。", "zh": "弄错吗？我是不是也弄错了什么呢。\n比如新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1063_009rit", "source_sha256": "7bc36621fbfbc24d46408add3d26d1c4f74fc340e1b450879f26420aa5b87f41", "ja": "いいえ。新曲、いい歌だと思います。\n……私は、好きです。", "zh": "不是的。我觉得，新歌是一首很棒的歌。\n……我很喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1064_009rit", "source_sha256": "8e1f0969a0cc134803a24310a6ce96bb937cfae553904f6afa4a8833363c5c65", "ja": "すごく、好きな……曲だから。\n私は、どう伝えたらいいのかなって……。", "zh": "因为是我非常喜欢的……歌曲。\n我该怎么表达才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1065_009rit", "source_sha256": "aad813f73eddd6af4f8712806a4655303153d52e968f5378624758fb4ac4d2d0", "ja": "何日も、ずっと考えて……。", "zh": "我想了好几天，一直在想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1067_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb06d7258d8b5df3e071be270363de643b78acd604e792732b622adedaffdd42", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってますか？\n私の家族……両親って、すごく仲がいいんです。", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道吗？\n我的家人……我的父母，关系特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1068_009rit", "source_sha256": "b91f80eae56ab276b765dfa66ef8cd17d696f78f2c409e0b8d5ed72b2923cd19", "ja": "一緒に商売をやっているんですけど。\n父の起こした事業を、母が支えていて……。", "zh": "他们一起做生意。\n父亲创办的事业，一直由母亲支持着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1069_009rit", "source_sha256": "31d9b9286fd1546a046d6f1e250b41d3f5376a7d814d5d51894af4c76ec65cd3", "ja": "私は、そんな両親を……ふたりの関係を、\n素敵だと思って。内心、憧れているんです……。", "zh": "我觉得那样的父母……以及他们两人的关系，非常美好。其实，我一直很憧憬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1070_p", "source_sha256": "924e74558525508f98ecdc51df21b5c53ab8ff30e59ac35e6c5d638dc1dc6285", "ja": "そうか。\n……律子は、家族の事が好きなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……律子很喜欢自己的家人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1071_009rit", "source_sha256": "0fbad5f15947e5771751455f09528b7cefcb972a06e1eb75df04bf06fa8a0ed3", "ja": "ええ。……あ、いえ！\n私が言いたいのは、そういう事じゃなくて……。", "zh": "嗯。……啊，不是！\n我想说的不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1072_009rit", "source_sha256": "94251d3dea6af2fc55e270380b39718b8fd97e8dd3c1d41881f19aedbac56fb3", "ja": "そうじゃなくて……ただ私は、\n仕事のできる人を、その、尊敬するっていうか。", "zh": "不是那样……只是，我呢，对工作能力强的人，那个……该说是尊敬吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1073_009rit", "source_sha256": "88a98a4dec2ecf4c88222a1dbd1a5e315ea673d3952d1630c38eb1d52cb41683", "ja": "好き……なんです。\nきっと……。", "zh": "喜欢……这种人。\n一定是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1074_p", "source_sha256": "346297747b5c5f2b76310edc0bb0d8aa733a0c0f2fb01790771bd32cf10e3b86", "ja": "仕事ができる人への憧れか……その気持ちなら、\n俺にもわかるよ、俺は社長を尊敬しているし。", "zh": "是对工作能力强的人的憧憬吗……如果是这种心情，我也能理解。我也很尊敬社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1075_009rit", "source_sha256": "d46a1d3d8c9e05e65484d48b7bea70e803d81f8f028b966f83a84e8940d1e5f7", "ja": "そうですよね？　そうなんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊，对吧？确实是这样，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1076_009rit", "source_sha256": "1da9f509adf991b80cc1fe65b93394bff7a667999c95ba457d24bd65ebb68d6e", "ja": "私もいつか、そんなふうになれたらって。\nただ、そう考えていただけなのに……。", "zh": "我也只是想着，有一天要是能变成那样就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1077_p", "source_sha256": "b1c34934408199a3eb32a1e7323ee4071520e56d681327cecbbe2b0fcda9d1dd", "ja": "律子……？", "zh": "律子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1078_009rit", "source_sha256": "2025e9f334e73f688fe06d252a1c87d17732bc2c05cf5985c7e43b008e900111", "ja": "こんなのがそう呼べるのか、わからないですけど。\nぐちゃぐちゃだし、うまく言えないけど、でも……。", "zh": "虽然不知道这种状态能不能称得上是这样。\n乱七八糟的，也说不清楚，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1079_009rit", "source_sha256": "c33ea7fdece95ac05fb33153179c326a612a80fa7eac2261ce039d443b461c96", "ja": "私は、……その人に、相応しい存在になりたいんです。\n仕事相手としても……その、パートナーとしても。", "zh": "我想成为一个配得上那个人的存在……无论是作为工作上的搭档，还是……作为伴侣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1080_009rit", "source_sha256": "dc4f88835da27391b9944f561a91a429871cd4fff2618414469357c9f48cfd37", "ja": "……だ、だから！　私に歌わせたいなら、私のこと、\n{$P$}に知っててほしくて！", "zh": "……所、所以！如果想让我唱歌，我希望{$P$}先生能了解我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1081_009rit", "source_sha256": "da9a0212308d8766af0b0997ecfa8b80c4d545b5df2ecd2c1eb56521d001dfb7", "ja": "私が何を考えているかとか、どう不安なのかとか……\nただ、聞いて……分け合ってほしかったんです。", "zh": "我在想什么、我有什么不安……\n只是想让你……听我说，和我一起分担。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1082_p", "source_sha256": "ff7435c5bcd6b37f93428d694c4147f820aebc91c9b4ca2d49ac6bb4c503a700", "ja": "俺は……律子の事を、わかってるつもりだった。", "zh": "我……原以为自己是了解律子的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1083_009rit", "source_sha256": "720887c0859ee8c992ae92c64a57ed791f22619ed512d55a9e4465676e248a37", "ja": "つもりじゃ、ダメなんですよ。", "zh": "光是自以为了解，还不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1084_p", "source_sha256": "4418ac69fff1ec82bc470b33d9e200827fda406b98be2f1b01bb9bf26afcd491", "ja": "そうだな、そのとおりだ。\n……不安にさせてしまって、本当にすまなかった。", "zh": "是啊，确实如此。\n……真的很抱歉，让你感到不安了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1085_p", "source_sha256": "b4e90af09555d93f72b91678e586578dc830ac1a76396f3e832e98f0a0503bac", "ja": "今からでも遅くないなら、いくらでも……\n話を聞かせて欲しい。それと。", "zh": "只要现在还不算晚，多少都可以……\n请把事情告诉我。还有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1086_009rit", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1087_p", "source_sha256": "68cdfd595edf69d87556026f0929adb8a56d27d7d18109996eeeddf4ea68a584", "ja": "いつか、伝わるといいな。\nその……律子が言う、その人に。", "zh": "希望有一天，能传达给那个人就好了。\n就是……律子所说的那个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1088_009rit", "source_sha256": "8c53435c8ad79fa5e9a5a587476dbc4105d9ba2821f725a37efbe7e1a97c13d5", "ja": "……ふふっ。そうですね。\nふふ、あははっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。是啊。\n呵呵，啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1089_p", "source_sha256": "1edec7a8fcf34b13474d849f7315fc39268eb63e250f5727a2313998dbb26abd", "ja": "り、律子？", "zh": "律、律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1090_009rit", "source_sha256": "726f28ec54cfb56f3e35828f31c3cb4e9eef66ccd1b3aab558e01da542b83476", "ja": "いいえ。……そう、本当にね。\n伝わるといいんですけど、いつになるやら。", "zh": "没事。……是啊，真的呢。\n能传达给他们就好了，但还不知道要等到什么时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1091_p", "source_sha256": "0cdc818f5b0f54c42a054b08a366322986d43b8e1b0f861037f98e9909706998", "ja": "それが律子の本当の気持ちなら、きっと伝わるよ。\n俺も、律子の話が聞けてよかったしな。", "zh": "如果那是律子真正的想法，一定能传达给大家的。\n我能听律子说这些，也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1093_009rit", "source_sha256": "84d3eb74d9a06acf8f0629bc0e03632183cbd0350a79a443bf9e9051c9d1d8b2", "ja": "よし。じゃあ、私もそろそろ行きますか。\n公演のみんなに、新曲の方針、伝えなきゃ。", "zh": "好。那我也差不多该出发了。\n得去把新曲的方针传达给公演的大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1094_p", "source_sha256": "3e4cbceed1a7e57946706103acbd7be82c1f6b704c5ace614271f2112fdfd371", "ja": "ああ。頼んだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1095_p", "source_sha256": "f182d20ee8b156cacc50c72e69332f7a5b0f69aeab537fa272e32af640dbbdda", "ja": "（プロデューサーが、アイドルの不安を請け負うのは\n当然……今回は、律子に甘えすぎてしまったな）", "zh": "（作为制作人，承担偶像们的不安是理所当然的……这次太依赖律子了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_097_1096_p", "source_sha256": "a2ea4b4c8b505e36c36c6772208c4a66c27805eb62005a6865bde8f3c2a6394a", "ja": "（少し遅くなったけど、律子とたくさん話をしよう。\nこの先、ずっと……共に歩き続けるためにも）", "zh": "（虽然有些晚了，但还是和律子好好聊聊吧。为了今后也能一直……和她并肩走下去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
